{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139500/extras/e902bde0f6009c8fb957890c04ca0f57.poster.avif?t=1761922400\" width=400 height=104 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139500/extras/e902bde0f6009c8fb957890c04ca0f57.webm?t=1761922400\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139500/extras/e902bde0f6009c8fb957890c04ca0f57.mp4?t=1761922400\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Suitable for all ages, <strong>Chicks In Trouble</strong>\u00a0offers a heart warming puzzle/action adventure that can be played by either mouse/touchpad or gamepad. Through our father Rooster's journey, you'll try to find your way to the lost chicks, avoid farm owners and animals, collect power ups and solve different puzzles to bring a happy ending into the story!\u00a0\ud83d\udc23</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump into our early demo and get a feel for the adventure! We\u2019ve put together a special level packed with action and puzzles to keep things interesting. Have fun, and don\u2019t forget to <strong>wishlist</strong> and tell us what you think \u2014 we\u2019d love your feedback! \ud83d\udc4d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4139500?t=1761922400","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4139500?t=1761922400","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139500/345f8c1636a39a460d1da8228269f191e14488d5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761922400","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139500/345f8c1636a39a460d1da822826